  "quiz_markdown": "### Q1. Smooth voice leading prefers:\n\n- A) Small steps and common tones\n- B) Large leaps always\n- C) Parallel octaves always\n- D) Random chord tones\n\n**Answer:** A\n\n### Q2. Contrary motion: one voice rises, another falls.\n\n**Answer:** True",
